{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0002::Text::1", "source_sha256": "f74b13570b0bec003c97fe084fac419f951ab452bb537728f0f218f254f4059d", "target": "{#DialogueItalicFormat}Mmmm... kkatiil..."}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/ZagreusField_1424::Text::1", "source_sha256": "29952d43246cd76c5bbba3a98ef75098378a6e680c379ce4aa6e410524380623", "target": "Sen Meg’in kardeşlerinden biri olmalısın! Sonunda tanıştığımıza sevindim. Benim adım Zagreus. {#DialogueItalicFormat}Katil{#PreviousFormat} değil. Kesinlikle değil."}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0003::Text::1", "source_sha256": "0f1f76063568a38e94051f252e96e7cef4071a39d011479fe929418bc04530ee", "target": "Katil... {#DialogueItalicFormat}kkkaatiill...!"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/ZagreusField_1425::Text::1", "source_sha256": "587fa510a530c01997d402070b01b6ceeb9352abf127a0291e3fd591ac824485", "target": "{#DialogueItalicFormat}Şey{#PreviousFormat}... bak, yaptığım her şey pek iyi sayılmaz belki ama hiç cinayet işlemediğimden çok, çok eminim."}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0004::Text::1", "source_sha256": "3bbd211cdc7d7c3d8d09bde1ef41576a26d72f58cf740f02498e490defe69071", "target": "{#DialogueItalicFormat}Kkkkaatiill{#PreviousFormat}...!"}
{"key": "Content/Subtitles/en/ZagreusField.csv::ZagreusField_4545::Line::1", "source_sha256": "0df6e6d51af1fbe05f2b498c7ae3f11044c28f7036e1fdac54e378b6d71818ca", "target": "Pekâlâ, işe koyulalım o zaman!"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/ZagreusField_4544::Text::1", "source_sha256": "5406704ca1b237dd11861dca9186b9256985dc89dbc71685ebce0d66af9e9935", "target": "Bu sefer resmî bir iş için geldim, Tisiphone, o yüzden, {#DialogueItalicFormat}şey{#PreviousFormat}... kenara çekil! Gerçi bu işin asıl amacı senin yine beni durdurmaya çalışman galiba, değil mi?"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0026::Text::1", "source_sha256": "275964fed3bfb36fb44c85b74f4dacf9a162cfc6d6d733c5914fbddee5d83a01", "target": "Mmm, hrr-hrr-{#DialogueItalicFormat}yyeet{#PreviousFormat}..."}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0026::Text::2", "source_sha256": "897988efa2615121c2c1d4577ffcfc7e84dcab779c9617cc2f780d4cd81df90a", "target": "Mmm-hhhm-hmm-cciinnaayeet..."}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/ZagreusField_4546::Text::1", "source_sha256": "70e95f0bf6568c34420ff279162ae8690f6606290ee360d5d27c259b932fc32d", "target": "Konak’taki şölene gelemediğine üzüldüm, Tisiphone. Gerçi pek sana göre bir ortam değildi bence. Ama Ares oradaydı, o birkaç cinayet işlemiştir herhâlde, değil mi?"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0019::Text::1", "source_sha256": "acfd61bc8d8743848a1c5c74565ec0febee6455b06687eadae9ecc7d02678e49", "target": "Cciinnaayeet? Cciinnaayet. {#DialogueItalicFormat}Ciinnaayet{#PreviousFormat}!"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0019::Text::2", "source_sha256": "8d18a0ed14f63430d6a14a791f24c49790fe3102efd33cdd01b9a469c0385ee1", "target": "Cinayet...? Cciinnaayet. Ciinnaayet!"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0005::Text::1", "source_sha256": "fd7cc845ffea9c386d53de1e923fad616f063c6240e8c91e968b1c409ae69947", "target": "{#DialogueItalicFormat}Cciinnaa{#PreviousFormat}... yet...?"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/ZagreusField_1426::Text::1", "source_sha256": "ac7756eb7f4e45c2720a332060cd9cfdc0adab01895ccef9009fd8e8184cb987", "target": "{#DialogueItalicFormat}Şey{#PreviousFormat}... hayır desem? Cinayet yok. Cinayet yok!"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0006::Text::1", "source_sha256": "872dc9688060a8db6663c9847a125e0d37f4235d3f7e2269f7f6818bf8c846cb", "target": "{#DialogueItalicFormat}Ccciinnaayeet....{#PreviousFormat}"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0007::Text::1", "source_sha256": "249e08c9b5c1e2f6dc612579a3b1300301fc8bc4cfcc8fcd06403d4594c2b26d", "target": "Cinayet...? Cinayet, cciinnaayet...!"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/ZagreusField_1427::Text::1", "source_sha256": "582ec3f328920567aaf1d78e6672e92747b50526ff95095c90fd98530cd08d2d", "target": "Konuyu değiştiririz diye umuyordum. Lütfen?"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0008::Text::1", "source_sha256": "769a3cdc340273d233817a3a59260c8b845f51268bb03ab4e30a1b6e18844d5d", "target": "Kkaatiil... {#DialogueItalicFormat}kkaatiill{#PreviousFormat}!"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0009::Text::1", "source_sha256": "3b3fca04913f3b771ae376e74a4ed93ad2ea8dae3ac1b315ef38a630c4a38ccf", "target": "Mmm... mmm.... mmmrrrr....!"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/ZagreusField_1428::Text::1", "source_sha256": "91fa4059c98614aacebb96c8e5d0dfb715899166b006738953e500b62b8971b4", "target": "Dur tahmin edeyim. Cinayet? Belki katil? Bu ikisinden biri."}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0010::Text::1", "source_sha256": "380bc52afaafcc77c0fc183bd515d242862bbc54edad7936778f3df14ac094cd", "target": "Mmm, cciinnaayet... cciinnaayet!!"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0011::Text::1", "source_sha256": "8b05fdba6c1b7f98d09c9b1cab7fef5f0b6e8976f28e2f62e558d0883c4f2dbc", "target": "Mmmrrrrr... cciinnaa, yeet...."}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/ZagreusField_1429::Text::1", "source_sha256": "24428dc0247f2e5f9932298df82668a2d6a7a395abfbc70ebe4ea4db9d794ff7", "target": "Lütfen, ben katil değilim, bunu yapmak zorunda değilsin."}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0012::Text::1", "source_sha256": "b3870672cdc945fac12c5c0658a84771a5042faa27c2cef2cf44e818e954bb8c", "target": "Katil. Kkaatiill...."}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0013::Text::1", "source_sha256": "0278addf006ce5c6951daa91bf1aaa2707a5e27e742310b2562ce168275c5028", "target": "Kkaatiill... cinayet, cinayet, {#DialogueItalicFormat}cinayet{#PreviousFormat}!"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/ZagreusField_1430::Text::1", "source_sha256": "b093c307f7262fc801c38027775ac504654897136cc4d6c60cd61f66d751ccab", "target": "Birbirimize bir türlü laf anlatamıyoruz, değil mi. Üzgünüm, böyle olması gerekiyor."}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0014::Text::1", "source_sha256": "2cba81e8673e7584f19addf6d8ad159c446bd6e2a95ed450ef95091b2a5d26d0", "target": "Katil. {#DialogueItalicFormat}Kkaatiill{#PreviousFormat}!!"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0015::Text::1", "source_sha256": "cf433e4de32e4c70876bbb5dd9df6e754047801debddda97b94e5652324b2ab2", "target": "Cinayet? {#DialogueItalicFormat}Cinayet{#PreviousFormat}...? Cinayet...."}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/ZagreusField_1431::Text::1", "source_sha256": "5241bda229e28f769932f2a6d20b6a12eefd34e78a89ab3639b8eb61618bc643", "target": "Anlamıyorum. Ama sandığın kişi değilim. Babam seni beni durdurman için gönderdi, hepsi bu."}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0016::Text::1", "source_sha256": "658e0bc8a47eb310904e05f6d5a8f033fc13ea9183edec2c9463d13600fe9b22", "target": "Katil... katil! {#DialogueItalicFormat}Katil{#PreviousFormat}!"}
{"key": "Content/Subtitles/en/ZagreusField.csv::ZagreusField_3825::Line::1", "source_sha256": "73c3af6e51d9bd65f07f8d423080a0f799fd8c5c8447603b3a595829876f76ce", "target": "Cinayetzer?!"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0097::Text::1", "source_sha256": "b2df3fbf9dcab41a8d226a9c03608fddf8222bee1d2440c8d52f330d532bf4fe", "target": "Mrrr... cina.. yet... {#DialogueItalicFormat}cciinnaayeet{#PreviousFormat}!"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/ZagreusField_3824::Text::1", "source_sha256": "19b025d99d4b3b9bd55ef6af94b3d8c7b521970092fdc7187ceaf61a6d8f02c6", "target": "Cinayet değil. Zagreus. Benim adım Zagreus! Söyleyebilir misin, Tisiphone? Cinayet yok. {#DialogueItalicFormat}Zagreus{#PreviousFormat}!"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0098::Text::1", "source_sha256": "431bbf123caf2193eff322b06669b07c414b90232772702cf3be1ac43097bde1", "target": "Cina... yet... {#DialogueItalicFormat}zerrr{#PreviousFormat}...."}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0099::Text::1", "source_sha256": "ea2cadfa4dd4d69d176687a862296ca61428e5990b8271817747400a55a21481", "target": "Mm, cina... yet... zerrr!"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/ZagreusField_3826::Text::1", "source_sha256": "99ea381518f869eeff5a745d0eb8964a17a0e60551b0c8088e04a6b19f4edd7b", "target": "Gerçekten {#DialogueItalicFormat}cinayetzer{#PreviousFormat} dedin, değil mi! İlerliyoruz! Zagreus! Ben Zagreus’um, katil değilim! Zagreus diyebilir misin?"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0100::Text::1", "source_sha256": "f92edbb0ff8a92afe3c66b12be2b238eb504b433c48833ed170aaf554048afec", "target": "Yet... zerr... zahh... zahh, {#DialogueItalicFormat}graaahh{#PreviousFormat}!"}
{"key": "Content/Subtitles/en/ZagreusField.csv::ZagreusField_3828::Line::1", "source_sha256": "64cac39975274bf85bdaf0eaecf916ee46bfa44066514468d77db8d65cce58f0", "target": "Az kaldı!"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0101::Text::1", "source_sha256": "31214311e3756878bb1e52d38d42551fd7d17547f8279a4cca5901a9e9300502", "target": "Zerr... znnhh... zrrrnggh...!"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/ZagreusField_3827::Text::1", "source_sha256": "d8c8de22285ffa78c99af167ee51f8ae4ddd10fd0d9568fdb514f3c22009b6c4", "target": "Beni hatırlıyor musun, Tisiphone? Benim adım Zagreus. Yeraltı Prensi? Megaera’yla epey yakınız sanırım. Benim için bir daha Zagreus demeyi dener misin?"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0102::Text::1", "source_sha256": "7e35f1dcd2b69b061fe480e021ed71c49ba8a79627258ed8264b9c8de91d7bc7", "target": "Zrrnngh... zaahh... zahh... gree... mrrsss...?"}
{"key": "Content/Subtitles/en/ZagreusField.csv::ZagreusField_3832::Line::1", "source_sha256": "09729e5f78018744f2809c76954aa88fc7eaf5421562779451b52265bc3e5908", "target": "Mutlu demedin..."}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0105::Text::1", "source_sha256": "fd1387ce0ab4af30dadcf21b202e7c993f92c5e94668ab46d6a443db41e51d40", "target": "{#DialogueItalicFormat}Zzzaaggreussss{#PreviousFormat}.... mm... kkaatiill...."}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/ZagreusField_3831::Text::1", "source_sha256": "70d4f2c81193c500ce8fa1644f68e6800512d3583bad2fc3411d5edacb25029e", "target": "Hayır. Dur. Sadece ilk kısmı. Katil yok. Yalnızca Zagreus. Ya da... dur bakalım, mesela... {#DialogueItalicFormat}mutlu{#PreviousFormat}? {#DialogueItalicFormat}Mutlu{#PreviousFormat} diyebilir misin?"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0106::Text::1", "source_sha256": "f115b261836025195a26f8510fa8216b86ec1be85d765e6c401f2a17b02cf484", "target": "Mmrrr... {#DialogueItalicFormat}Zzzaatiill{#PreviousFormat}...."}
{"key": "Content/Subtitles/en/ZagreusField.csv::ZagreusField_3834::Line::1", "source_sha256": "ad19b8cc2deb82c31378eef9b6262d5f620332381cdc995f470ec3a2c82585f2", "target": "Harika."}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0107::Text::1", "source_sha256": "fc28747598b9003d95455c683c285d9c9e5b262388a61300388f4e3f2566dd5b", "target": "Ciinnaayet... Zzaagreusss... {#DialogueItalicFormat}kkaatiill{#PreviousFormat}..."}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/ZagreusField_3833::Text::1", "source_sha256": "cd9cfa37b9c6440e503b2392e271676b9d87dda5407d28d65217f952b4b05906", "target": "{#DialogueItalicFormat}Şey{#PreviousFormat}, peki... bir daha {#DialogueItalicFormat}mutlu{#PreviousFormat} demeyi deneyelim mi? Mutlu? Cinayet yok, sadece mutlu. Hadi bakalım!"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0108::Text::1", "source_sha256": "0d293bfe01809a9f8c2507434d38d8d60e1e5f2aa525bd1bea0df47c172b4333", "target": "Cinayeet... cinayeet {#DialogueItalicFormat}Zzagreusss{#PreviousFormat}!"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0109::Text::1", "source_sha256": "612b8dd715da87722ce8fc38cf8c261533eb40c51dc4065072adc9b1508ad17f", "target": "Kkaa{#DialogueItalicFormat}tiill{#PreviousFormat}... znnnhh... zrrrnnggh..."}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/ZagreusField_3835::Text::1", "source_sha256": "4baf2f0f599ee060794e87699b6107b3ab430866f27be92ed17195b57d6bc0aa", "target": "{#DialogueItalicFormat}Of{#PreviousFormat}, {#DialogueItalicFormat}mutlu{#PreviousFormat} sözü pek işine yaramıyor galiba. Belki de mutluluğa en çok beni böyle öldürmeye çalışırken yaklaşıyorsundur. En azından adımı öğrendin, bu da bir şey, değil mi?"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0110::Text::1", "source_sha256": "a3fb7ba2ce76666e21d106e5187f5106e1e9823fcc3d587ead885347f4d327f8", "target": "{#DialogueItalicFormat}Cciinnaayet... Zzaagreusss{#PreviousFormat}..."}
{"key": "Content/Subtitles/en/ZagreusField.csv::ZagreusField_3837::Line::1", "source_sha256": "bb34c6b16e9bdaa788dfaf503a4e80cc78048a9df007460d6dd27386a992b277", "target": "Dostuz!"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0111::Text::1", "source_sha256": "0b4910cbc2423a07a689f5e6794a209c1958f7842d7c15665e45f0fcdf205000", "target": "Ccciinnaayet... {#DialogueItalicFormat}kkaatiill{#PreviousFormat}...."}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/ZagreusField_3836::Text::1", "source_sha256": "46b9f9d3ad2847396d78e296ee087fbc3209a6e8528cb31464c3e93568f1d2e4", "target": "...Başa döndük demek. Bak, bütün bu Zagreus ve mutlu laflarıyla sana bir şey anlatmaya çalışıyordum. Ama bunları anlayabiliyorsan, Tisiphone, bence sen olduğun gibi iyisin. Dost muyuz?"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0112::Text::1", "source_sha256": "dea3e9b651f3622893ef6944b11f7de3b5ea0ba4ef7e4dffa0e074d88a8be4ee", "target": "...Zzrrngh... zrrnnggh... {#DialogueItalicFormat}zzzaatiill!{#PreviousFormat}..."}
{"key": "Content/Subtitles/en/ZagreusField.csv::ZagreusField_4109::Line::1", "source_sha256": "2f734432c5daa4cba0fe03f4f8549ef0902785d70f021a5553fb64eb8b00807b", "target": "Ah, zaten sanmıyordum."}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0117::Text::1", "source_sha256": "c816c174ca59fba7db26621ebc8d248de43d92c4fc59bac21ab3ba762dd8da23", "target": "Zzz, zzaa... {#DialogueItalicFormat}Zaaggreus? {#PreviousFormat}Kkaatiil?"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0117::Text::2", "source_sha256": "c816c174ca59fba7db26621ebc8d248de43d92c4fc59bac21ab3ba762dd8da23", "target": "Zzz, zzaa... {#DialogueItalicFormat}Zaaggreus? {#PreviousFormat}Kkaatiil?"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/ZagreusField_4108::Text::1", "source_sha256": "c3af3aedaca736a21c65182481588a1aea8f14d4a4c1e90b0e4cdadda0e5244b", "target": "Hey, {#DialogueItalicFormat}şey{#PreviousFormat}, şu {#DialogueItalicFormat}mutlu{#PreviousFormat} meselesini tekrar düşündün mü acaba? Emin olayım dedim."}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0174::Text::1", "source_sha256": "bf6aa5fe8e0a4094e677601f494a0fe04817fe3987e743423b887be03cf2eafd", "target": "Zagreuss {#DialogueItalicFormat}kkaatiill{#PreviousFormat}!"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0017::Text::1", "source_sha256": "12c4977476127d3dcdbdb9c6fa23a56f9d4500937aae86547de5fdde9a769e83", "target": "Mmmmm, mmm, mmrrrrr...."}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0018::Text::1", "source_sha256": "1ed0fda24f171069c77e6eaee5cb4e95ec8af4825b1ddc12dd1806df9edccb28", "target": "Mm, kkaatiill.... Katiill!"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0020::Text::1", "source_sha256": "61cd057c8e22db5b5f3baf7624bb8b18eaaa9f03f8f4a6c892c48390da2b3427", "target": "Kkaatiill.... kkaatiill...!"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0021::Text::1", "source_sha256": "4b367722c54c661f97dcedf63397d2e8f76a7fcbe70e4f9d49ea80d35f10adfc", "target": "Mmm, cinayet? {#DialogueItalicFormat}Katil{#PreviousFormat}?"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0022::Text::1", "source_sha256": "cf436397d43362cd014ede807d835a9bc5b99ba3630406959e547a2e9e632c1d", "target": "Cinayet. Cinayet. Cinayet. {#DialogueItalicFormat}Cinayet. Cinayet{#PreviousFormat}!"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0023::Text::1", "source_sha256": "1f18c3ef42c2fbf04fb4fdc656d291f6c7bacf087d9133ba0a1b96fc466c9c94", "target": "Katil. Katil...! {#DialogueItalicFormat}Katil{#PreviousFormat}!"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0025::Text::1", "source_sha256": "70210a59bf5360a63fe0ddca06d42d32077e40d8a49221f5e3e5e769a46926fb", "target": "Kkkaatiill...?"}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0028::Text::1", "source_sha256": "b3252ff4bee46123413bcb4c262630a9ebfad008d462c04c134f14e6f37d6f4d", "target": "Ciinnaayet? Cciinnaayeet...."}
{"key": "Content/Scripts/EnemyData.lua::/VO/Tisiphone_0029::Text::1", "source_sha256": "a322884f41b5a25949b8add547d89ecc86fe03fe654e514a7974537897937fc9", "target": "Mmm... mmmrrrr... mrrrrr!"}
